{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "同一个哈希",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 68.68,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "一个联盟链网络，所有节点都由成员机构运营。",
   "spoken": "一个联盟链网络，所有节点都由成员机构运营。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "每个参与者，都持有一张有效的证书。",
   "spoken": "每个参与者，都持有一张有效的证书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 6.3,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 6.396,
   "speechEnd": 9.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "没有匿名的陌生人，也没有人能靠算力闯进来。",
   "spoken": "没有匿名的陌生人，也没有人能靠算力闯进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 9.88,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 9.977,
   "speechEnd": 14.313
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "可就在这样的网络里，账本分叉了。",
   "spoken": "可就在这样的网络里，账本分叉了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 14.74,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 14.74,
   "speechEnd": 18.204
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "Hyperledger Fabric 公布过这样一个漏洞。",
   "spoken": "Hyperledger Fabric 公布过这样一个漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 18.64,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 18.64,
   "speechEnd": 21.191
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "攻击者能把一个区块里的交易，重新组合。",
   "spoken": "攻击者能把一个区块里的交易，重新组合。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 21.58,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 21.676,
   "speechEnd": 24.762
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "区块哈希没有变。",
   "spoken": "区块哈希没有变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 25.16,
   "dur": 1.6,
   "speechStart": 25.16,
   "speechEnd": 26.581
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "可是不同的节点，从同一个区块里，解析出了不同的交易。",
   "spoken": "可是不同的节点，从同一个区块里，解析出了不同的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 26.98,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 26.98,
   "speechEnd": 31.899
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "收到不同版本的节点，各自写入世界状态，两份账本从此对不上。",
   "spoken": "收到不同版本的节点，各自写入世界状态，两份账本从此对不上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 32.32,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 32.32,
   "speechEnd": 37.97
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "修复的方向是，让哈希的编码没有歧义，同一串字节，只能读出同一组交易。",
   "spoken": "修复的方向是，让哈希的编码没有歧义，同一串字节，只能读出同一组交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 38.38,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 38.38,
   "speechEnd": 44.891
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "这里没有人偷到私钥，也没有人攻破共识。",
   "spoken": "这里没有人偷到私钥，也没有人攻破共识。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 45.32,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 45.412,
   "speechEnd": 50.064
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "门禁再严，挡住的也只是外人。",
   "spoken": "门禁再严，挡住的也只是外人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 50.5,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 50.595,
   "speechEnd": 53.456
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "那么，一个只让熟人进门的区块链，风险到底在哪里？",
   "spoken": "那么，一个只让熟人进门的区块链，风险到底在哪里？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 53.92,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 54.012,
   "speechEnd": 59.212
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "谁能写，谁能看，谁能改规则？",
   "spoken": "谁能写，谁能看，谁能改规则？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
   "start": 59.94,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 59.94,
   "speechEnd": 63.896
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-14",
   "text": "我们从一栋刷卡进门的写字楼说起。",
   "spoken": "我们从一栋刷卡进门的写字楼说起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-14.wav",
